name 'iterating-with-ai-postassessment-q7_2025'

question 'A record in your database is missing a `phone_number` field. How should the rendering logic handle this to maintain a professional UI?'

wrong 'Stop the loop and refuse to render any more items.'
right 'Use a fallback string like "N/A" or "No phone provided" to fill the space.'
wrong 'Leave the space entirely blank without a label.'
wrong 'Delete that record from the database automatically.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 5

Handling missing or null fields with fallbacks ensures the layout remains consistent and the user isn't confused by missing information.
MARKDOWN
